# Normalize line endings for all text files and keep binaries untouched.
# This repository is developed on Windows and Linux; LF in the index keeps
# diffs stable regardless of the local platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg text eol=lf
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
